From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:50:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] Pimax: preferences page and eye-tracking tools card

- Preferences > Pimax: refresh rate, render scale, IPD (lens motors) and render
  IPD offset, eye tracking on/off, calibration value, axis flip, quad views,
  SLAM / controller tracking. Stored as global env vars for the driver.
- Main view card: Recalibrate (pimax-et-calibrate; saves PIMAX_EYE_CALIB and
  offers a session restart), Gaze Test, Foveation Test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
